{
  "uid": "ts-bench-proof",
  "title": "TicketSphere - Benchmark Proof (burst)",
  "tags": [
    "benchmark",
    "booking"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": true,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "title": "How to read this",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### 3k RPS burst proof\n**Throughput**: bookings land in RabbitMQ (1 msg/booking) -> `messages published / s` should pin at the offered rate.\n**Latency**: `cache_latency_seconds{boundedKey=book_seats}` = full Redis atomic-check-and-lock (client side, incl. pool wait). `redis_commands_latencies` = Redis's own execution time (server truth).\n**Saturation**: booking CPU cores vs rate; projection queue depth must stay flat (drain keeps up).\n\nLaptop PL1 = 55W sustained -> honest ceiling ~1.7-2k/s all-in-one-box. Bursts ride PL2 (4.5+ GHz)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "title": "Booking throughput (server truth) - msg/s published to projection queue",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "cps",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "rate(rabbitmq_queue_messages_published_total[30s])",
          "legendFormat": "bookings/s"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 3
      },
      "title": "Atomic check-and-lock latency (book_seats, client-side incl. pool) - ms",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(cache_latency_seconds_bucket{boundedKey=\"book_seats\"}[30s])) by (le)) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(cache_latency_seconds_bucket{boundedKey=\"book_seats\"}[30s])) by (le)) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(cache_latency_seconds_bucket{boundedKey=\"book_seats\"}[30s])) by (le)) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
